   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "11 HOURS. MEDIAN.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 74
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody quit this Steam\ndemo in under ten minutes.\nNot one reviewer.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.303,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The median player had\neleven hours in before\nthey wrote anything.",
   "start": 4.553,
   "duration": 3.886,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Guildrun is a PvE\nautobattler roguelike. You\ndraft a team of heroes,\nthen watch the fight\nresolve itself.",
   "start": 12.689,
   "duration": 7.726,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. It's Unity,\nand twenty four assembly\nnames leak out of a data\nfile. Here's what they\ninstalled.",
   "start": 20.665,
   "duration": 6.863,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Sentry for crash reports.\nSQLite for three hundred\nrelics. Zero-allocation\nLINQ. That's not a first\nproject's list.",
   "start": 27.778,
   "duration": 7.882,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
